flowchart LR
    A[New week's data<br/>arrives] --> B{Row exists for<br/>run_id + snapshot_date<br/>+ state?}
    B -->|yes| C[UPDATE<br/>existing row]
    B -->|no| D[INSERT<br/>new row]
    C --> E[(RAW.COVID_DEATHS_RAW)]
    D --> E

    classDef decision fill:#FAEEDA,stroke:#854F0B,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#412402
    classDef action fill:#EEEDFE,stroke:#534AB7,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#3C3489
    classDef storage fill:#E1F5EE,stroke:#0F6E56,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#04342C
    classDef input fill:#E6F1FB,stroke:#185FA5,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#0C447C

    class A input
    class B decision
    class C,D action
    class E storage